Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: draws gTwinrovaHaloDL above the actor and its gCircleShadowDL ground shadow
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c.

